---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import aboutImg from '../assets/images/morgan-about.jpg';

const meta = {
  title: 'About Morgan Alexander | Dallas Independent Companion',
  description: 'Meet Morgan Alexander, one of Dallas\u2019s premier independent private entertainers. California native, Texas charm, 100% independent and discreet.',
};
---
<Base title={meta.title} description={meta.description}>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'AboutPage',
    name: 'About Morgan Alexander',
    url: 'https://theeroticmorgan.com/about-me/',
  })} />
  <section class="section split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">About Me</p>
      <h1>Dallas&rsquo;s Independent Companion</h1>
      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
        <p class="answer">My name is Morgan and I am one of Dallas&rsquo;s premier private entertainers. I am 100% independent, DDF, college-educated, and everything between us stays between us.</p>
        <p>Hi everyone! My name is Morgan and I am one of Dallas&rsquo;s premier private entertainers. I am a California native but have lived in Dallas long enough to be considered a Texan. I have been an escort off and on for many years and I feel that the services I offer are meaningful and important in people&rsquo;s lives. We all need companionship and intimacy in our lives and I am happy to provide that. I am 100% independent, meaning everything that happens between us is only for us. No one else will ever have access to any information you provide.</p>
        <p>I take great care of myself. I exercise and try to eat clean and healthy food (although I do love a good cheeseburger), and I am DDF (drug and disease free). I love the outdoors and truly enjoy hiking, camping, and fishing. I love all of the typical girl things like shopping and travel and spending time with friends. I love a good steak and nice wine. I don&rsquo;t really follow sports, but I love going to sporting events (except baseball. I will not). It&rsquo;s pretty much my philosophy that any activity is fun with the right company.</p>
        <p>I am college-educated and fun to talk to. I can engage in any sort of conversation but I will always try to keep things light and positive. You can share as much or as little about yourself as you&rsquo;d like. I try to match your energy in that regard. I don&rsquo;t mind if you want to keep things mostly anonymous between us and on the other hand, I would count some of my clients among my best friends and we know pretty much everything about each other. It&rsquo;s completely up to you how personal you want our relationship to be.</p>
        <p>Most importantly, I am a highly sexual person and I love to please and to be pleased. I say a lot on here but I know what you are calling for and do it very well. Your satisfaction is guaranteed. I can show you much better than I can tell you.</p>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top:2rem;"><a class="btn" href="/appointment-request/">Book time with me</a></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <Image src={aboutImg} alt="Elegant portrait of a sophisticated woman with a gentle smile." widths={[480, 768, 1080]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 40vw" class="portrait" loading="eager" />
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
